{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24074","headline":"洛阳有愚叟 · 白居易","name":"洛阳有愚叟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"洛阳有愚叟，白黑无分别。\n浪迹虽似狂，谋身亦不拙。\n点检盘中饭，非精亦非粝。\n点检身上衣，无余亦无阙。\n天时方得所，不寒复不热。\n体气正调和，不饥仍不渴。\n闲将酒壶出，醉向人家歇。\n野食或烹鲜，寓眠多拥褐。\n抱琴荣啓乐，荷锸刘伶达。\n放眼看青山，任头生白发。\n不知天地内，更得几年活。\n从此到终身，尽爲闲日月。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24074.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24074","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}